Package: sd-mass-uploader
Version: {version}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: {maintainer}
Installed-Size: {installed_kb}
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, udisks2, polkitd | policykit-1, usbutils, util-linux, adduser
Recommends: gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-notify-0.7
Suggests: cage
Description: SD card upload station (read-only, verified, PeakAI-ready)
 Reads many SD cards at once through USB readers, never writing to them, and
 uploads every file to Google Cloud Storage, checking each one. Includes the
 always-on station service, the Operator Console, a panel indicator with
 notifications, kiosk mode, PeakAI pass routing and the AI troubleshooter.
